    "微信 / QQ 文件专区、空间占用图需要读取资源库里的文件夹。权限只用来在本机读取，文件从不上传；拾掇只在检查更新和激活授权时联网。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "WeChat / QQ files and the storage map need to read folders in your Library. The permission is only used to read files on this Mac, and nothing is ever uploaded. Shiduo only goes online to check for updates and activate a license."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
