    "没有找到移动硬盘、NAS 或网盘文件夹。接上移动硬盘，或者点「选择文件夹…」。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "No external drive, NAS or cloud folder found. Connect a drive, or click “Choose Folder…”."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "没有找到移动硬盘、NAS 或网盘文件夹。接上移动硬盘，或者点「选择文件夹…」。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "在原位置留替身": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Leave an alias in the original place"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在原位置留替身"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "原来的位置会留一个访达替身，双击它就能打开搬走的文件（目标盘要连着）。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "A Finder alias stays where the file was. Double-click it to open the moved file (the destination must be connected)."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "原来的位置会留一个访达替身，双击它就能打开搬走的文件（目标盘要连着）。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "按原文件夹分类存放": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Group by original folder"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "按原文件夹分类存放"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "放在目标里的「拾掇搬家/原文件夹名」下。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Files go into “Shiduo Moved/<original folder>” at the destination."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "放在目标里的「拾掇搬家/原文件夹名」下。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "直接放在目标文件夹里。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Files go directly into the destination folder."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "直接放在目标文件夹里。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "iCloud 和网盘同步文件夹也在这台 Mac 的磁盘上：要等上传完成，再在访达里右键「移除下载」，才会真正腾出空间。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "iCloud and cloud sync folders are on this Mac's disk too: space is only freed after the upload finishes and you choose “Remove Download” in Finder."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "iCloud 和网盘同步文件夹也在这台 Mac 的磁盘上：要等上传完成，再在访达里右键「移除下载」，才会真正腾出空间。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "跨盘时先完整拷贝、核对大小，再删除原文件；出错会保留原文件。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Across drives, each file is fully copied and size-checked before the original is removed. On any error the original is kept."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "跨盘时先完整拷贝、核对大小，再删除原文件；出错会保留原文件。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
