    "取消后，已经搬完的文件留在新位置（可以在「清理记录」里放回），没搬完的保持原样。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "If you cancel, files already moved stay at the destination (you can move them back in Cleanup History); the rest are left untouched."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "取消后，已经搬完的文件留在新位置（可以在「清理记录」里放回），没搬完的保持原样。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
