    "目标和原文件在同一块磁盘上，这台 Mac 暂时没有腾出空间。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The destination is on the same disk, so no space has been freed on this Mac yet."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "目标和原文件在同一块磁盘上，这台 Mac 暂时没有腾出空间。"
