    "更新后需要重新授权一次": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Grant access once more after this update"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "更新后需要重新授权一次"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "macOS 把新版本的拾掇当成了一个新的 App，之前开的「完全磁盘访问权限」暂时失效了，微信 / QQ 专区和空间占用图会读不到文件。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "macOS treats the new version of Shiduo as a different app, so the Full Disk Access you granted earlier has stopped working. The WeChat / QQ section and the storage map can't read files until you grant it again."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "macOS 把新版本的拾掇当成了一个新的 App，之前开的「完全磁盘访问权限」暂时失效了，微信 / QQ 专区和空间占用图会读不到文件。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "如果你之前给拾掇开过「完全磁盘访问权限」：macOS 把新版本当成了一个新的 App，这个权限暂时失效了，微信 / QQ 专区和空间占用图会读不到文件。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "If you gave Shiduo Full Disk Access before: macOS treats the new version as a different app, so that access has stopped working. The WeChat / QQ section and the storage map can't read files until you grant it again."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "如果你之前给拾掇开过「完全磁盘访问权限」：macOS 把新版本当成了一个新的 App，这个权限暂时失效了，微信 / QQ 专区和空间占用图会读不到文件。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "点下面的「打开系统设置」，进入「隐私与安全性 › 完全磁盘访问权限」": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Click “Open System Settings” below to go to Privacy & Security › Full Disk Access"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "点下面的「打开系统设置」，进入「隐私与安全性 › 完全磁盘访问权限」"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "在列表里选中旧的「拾掇」，点下方的「−」把它删掉": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Select the old “Shiduo” entry in the list and click “−” to remove it"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在列表里选中旧的「拾掇」，点下方的「−」把它删掉"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "点「+」，在「应用程序」里选择「拾掇」添加进去（也可以直接把拾掇拖进列表）": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Click “+” and choose Shiduo in Applications (or just drag Shiduo into the list)"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
