    "“下载”里超过 %lld 天的 .dmg / .pkg 自动移到废纸篓，30 天内可以在「清理记录」里放回。拾掇开着时每 10 分钟检查一次。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Moves .dmg / .pkg files older than %lld days in Downloads to the Trash. Put them back from Cleanup History within 30 days. Checked every 10 minutes while Shiduo is open."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "“下载”里超过 %lld 天的 .dmg / .pkg 自动移到废纸篓，30 天内可以在「清理记录」里放回。拾掇开着时每 10 分钟检查一次。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
