    "给人脸盖上表情": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cover Faces with Emoji"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "给人脸盖上表情"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "在本机识别真人的脸，每张脸盖一个表情。点中表情可以换、拖动，滑块改大小。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Finds real faces on this Mac and covers each with an emoji. Click one to change or drag it; use the slider to resize."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在本机识别真人的脸，每张脸盖一个表情。点中表情可以换、拖动，滑块改大小。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "裁剪": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Crop"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "裁剪"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "自由": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Free"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "自由"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "拖动画框、箭头、马赛克和裁剪范围，单击放文字、序号和表情；按住 ⇧ 画正方形或 45° 箭头。点中已有的标注可以拖动，按 ⌫ 删除。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Drag to draw boxes, arrows, mosaics and crop areas; click to place text, numbers and emoji. Hold ⇧ for squares or 45° arrows. Click a mark to drag it; press ⌫ to delete."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "拖动画框、箭头、马赛克和裁剪范围，单击放文字、序号和表情；按住 ⇧ 画正方形或 45° 箭头。点中已有的标注可以拖动，按 ⌫ 删除。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "在图上拖出要保留的范围，拖动框可以移动。存图和拷贝时只留框里的部分，标注照样保留。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Drag over the area to keep; drag the box to move it. Saving and copying keep only what is inside, marks included."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在图上拖出要保留的范围，拖动框可以移动。存图和拷贝时只留框里的部分，标注照样保留。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "卸载 App": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Uninstall App"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "卸载 App"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "没能把 %@ 移到废纸篓（可能需要管理员权限，或它正在运行），资源库里的数据一个没动。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Couldn’t move %@ to the Trash (it may need administrator permission, or it’s running). Nothing in your Library was touched."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "没能把 %@ 移到废纸篓（可能需要管理员权限，或它正在运行），资源库里的数据一个没动。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "先移走 App，成功后才移走勾选的残留。都只是移到废纸篓，30 天内可以在「清理记录」里放回。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The app is moved first; checked leftovers are moved only after that succeeds. Everything goes to the Trash and can be restored from Cleanup History within 30 days."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "先移走 App，成功后才移走勾选的残留。都只是移到废纸篓，30 天内可以在「清理记录」里放回。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "正在等它退出…": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Waiting for it to quit…"
