    "上色会在文件夹里放一个隐藏的 Icon 文件，git 里会多出一个未跟踪的 Icon?，建议在 .gitignore 里加上 Icon?": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Coloring puts a hidden Icon file in the folder, so git will show an untracked “Icon?”. Consider adding Icon? to .gitignore."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "上色会在文件夹里放一个隐藏的 Icon 文件，git 里会多出一个未跟踪的 Icon?，建议在 .gitignore 里加上 Icon?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "上色会在文件夹里放一个隐藏的 Icon 文件，同步盘可能把它同步到别的设备，在那边显示成一个空文件或颜色不见": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Coloring puts a hidden Icon file in the folder. Cloud sync may copy it to other devices, where it can show up as an empty file or the color may be lost."
          }
