    "重新编码，起止点和预览完全一致，画质尽量保持原样，稍慢一些。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Re-encodes so the start and end match the preview exactly, keeping quality as close to the original as possible. A bit slower."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "重新编码，起止点和预览完全一致，画质尽量保持原样，稍慢一些。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "不重新编码，几乎瞬间完成；但开始位置可能挪到最近的关键帧，片段会早开始一点。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "No re-encoding, almost instant — but the start may shift to the nearest keyframe, so the clip can begin slightly earlier."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "不重新编码，几乎瞬间完成；但开始位置可能挪到最近的关键帧，片段会早开始一点。"
          }
        }
