    "把常用的文件夹放上来，这里会变成一面卡片墙，一眼看到里面有什么。也可以直接把文件夹从访达拖到这里。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Add the folders you use most and they become a wall of cards that show what's inside. You can also drag folders here from Finder."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "把常用的文件夹放上来，这里会变成一面卡片墙，一眼看到里面有什么。也可以直接把文件夹从访达拖到这里。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "只有文件夹能放上文件夹墙；文件可以拖到某张卡片上，移进那个文件夹": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Only folders go on the Folder Wall. Drop files on a card to move them into that folder."
          }
