    "已开启「自动清理用过的安装包」。按规则自动把下载里的文件归类或移到废纸篓。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "“Clean up used installers” is on. Rules sort files in Downloads into folders or move them to the Trash."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已开启「自动清理用过的安装包」。按规则自动把下载里的文件归类或移到废纸篓。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "按规则自动把下载里的文件归类或移到废纸篓，比如自动清理用过的安装包。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Rules that sort files in Downloads into folders or move them to the Trash — for example, cleaning up used installers."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "按规则自动把下载里的文件归类或移到废纸篓，比如自动清理用过的安装包。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "“下载”里所有 .dmg / .pkg 都会移到废纸篓（这条规则没设天数，可以在下面的规则里改）。30 天内可以在「清理记录」里放回。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Every .dmg / .pkg in Downloads will be moved to the Trash (this rule has no age limit — change it in the rules below). You can put them back from Cleanup History within 30 days."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "“下载”里所有 .dmg / .pkg 都会移到废纸篓（这条规则没设天数，可以在下面的规则里改）。30 天内可以在「清理记录」里放回。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "点缩略图选择要移到废纸篓的文件": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Click thumbnails to choose files to move to the Trash"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "点缩略图选择要移到废纸篓的文件"
