    },
    "一次移动的比较多，先确认一下。随时可以从废纸篓里恢复，只在 iCloud 云端的文件会被跳过。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "That’s a lot at once, so please confirm. You can restore them from the Trash anytime. Files that are only in iCloud are skipped."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "一次移动的比较多，先确认一下。随时可以从废纸篓里恢复，只在 iCloud 云端的文件会被跳过。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
