    "文件夹图标": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Folder Icons"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "文件夹图标"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "「拾掇风格」：拾掇里看到的文件夹都是拾掇文件夹，上过色的保留颜色和图案，有自定义图标的把它放在文件夹上。「系统图标」：和访达里一样。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "“Shiduo style”: every folder you see in Shiduo is a Shiduo folder. Folders you colored keep their color and artwork; folders with a custom icon show it on the folder. “System icons”: the same as in Finder."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "「拾掇风格」：拾掇里看到的文件夹都是拾掇文件夹，上过色的保留颜色和图案，有自定义图标的把它放在文件夹上。「系统图标」：和访达里一样。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "重新打开拾掇": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Reopen Shiduo"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "重新打开拾掇"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "如果系统设置里已经打开还显示未开启：先退出拾掇，在列表里选中拾掇点「−」删掉，再点「+」重新添加并打开开关，然后重新打开拾掇。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "If it's already on in System Settings but still shows Off: quit Shiduo, select Shiduo in the list and click “−” to remove it, click “+” to add it again and turn the switch on, then reopen Shiduo."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "如果系统设置里已经打开还显示未开启：先退出拾掇，在列表里选中拾掇点「−」删掉，再点「+」重新添加并打开开关，然后重新打开拾掇。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "所有截图；数字是今天新增的张数": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "All screenshots; the number is how many were added today"
